# The machine-wide hardware lock's directory (louver/instance.py): one Louver
# at a time on the whole machine. Only plugdev, who can drive the hub and the
# fan headers anyway, can take or hold the lock. Setgid: the lock file is
# plugdev's. Sticky: nobody can unlink a lock another account's copy holds.
d /run/louver 3770 root plugdev -
